title: OS Command Injection in Web Request
id: 8d89e4c4-0125-468d-96c3-bae7fc9adfdc
status: experimental
description: Detects operating-system command injection payloads in HTTP requests, such as shell metacharacters chaining commands (;id, |whoami, backtick and dollar-paren substitution) against vulnerable web parameters.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1190/
logsource:
  category: webserver
detection:
  selection:
    cs-uri-query|contains:
      - ';id'
      - '|whoami'
      - '`id`'
      - '$(id)'
      - ';cat /etc/passwd'
      - '|| ping'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - cs-uri-query
  - cs-uri-stem
  - c-ip
falsepositives:
  - Security scanners
level: high
tags:
  - attack.initial_access
  - attack.t1190
